/*
 * Override of Starlight's ThemeSelect that renders nothing.
 *
 * Cascade docs are dark-only, so there is no light/dark/auto choice to offer.
 * Removing the control also removes the stock script that would otherwise
 * re-derive the theme from localStorage or the system setting and flip
 * `data-theme`, keeping the page locked to the dark value set in ThemeProvider.
 */
